1.4.4 Same--Transfer.

(A) _ Privately owned private or public facility permits may be transferred to a new owner or operator only if the permittee gives at least thirty (30) days' advance notice to the Town Council or its designated agent and the Town Council or its designated agent approves the privately owned private or public facility permit transfer. The notice to the Town Council or its designated agent must include a written certification by the new owner or operator which:

- (1) States that the new owner and/or operator has no immediate intent to change the facility's operations and processes;

- (2) Identifies the specific date on which the transfer is to occur; and

