1.4.6. Same--Reissuance.

A user with an expiring privately owned private or public facility permit shall apply for a privately owned private or public facility permit reissuance by submitting a complete permit application in accordance with 1.3.4 of this Ordinance, a minimum of not more than ninety (90) days and not less than sixty (60) days prior to the expiration of current permits.
